{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33594","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 三 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未领春闱望早清，况联戎阃控强兵。\n风威遍布江山静，教化高同日月明。\n九郡竟歌兼煮海，四方皆得共和羹。\n东南自此全无事，只爲期年政已成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}